description:
Provide technical maintenance services;
Diagnosis and technical delivery of XCMG equipment;
Work with mechanical and electrical systems of machines;
Perform repairs, assembly and disassembly of components;
Troubleshooting and preventive inspections of equipment;
Use technical manuals and special tools;
Ensure the cleanliness, conservation and organization of equipment and workplace;
Perform activities taking into account operational, Occupational Safety, Environmental and Quality procedures;
Perform other related activities necessary for the good performance of the sector.
